\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Man of Sorrows! What a name
\par For the Son of God, who came
\par Ruined sinners to reclaim!
\par Hallelujah! what a Saviour!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Bearing shame and scoffing rude,
\par In my place condemned He stood;
\par Sealed my pardon with His blood:
\par Hallelujah! what a Saviour!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Guilty, vile, and helpless we;
\par Spotless Lamb of God was He:
\par Full atonement- can it be?
\par Hallelujah! what a Saviour!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4
\par \cf0\ulnone\b0 4. Lifted up was He to die.
\par It is finished! was His cry;
\par Now in Heaven exalted high:
\par Hallelujah! what a Saviour!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. When He comes, our glorious King,
\par All His ransomed home to bring,
\par Then anew this song we'll sing:
\par Hallelujah! what a Saviour!
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

